            "review_title": "Review at Waterfall Dining Lounge",
            "review_text": "Chieu Tim B\nParis, France270 contributions\n0\nIt’s not a restaurant anymore, it’s been a bar for 2 months\nAug 2024 • Family\nThe property is located in a Centara Mirage resort in Mui Ne. To access it, electric carts drop you off from the Pension reception.\nThe staff is very friendly and helpful, and friendly but for 2 months it is just a bar, you can not have meals!\nThat’s why I put a 2/5. \nThe cocktails we ordered were just fine, no more.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 23, 2024",
