            "review_title": "Review at Waterfall Dining Lounge",
            "review_text": "Ken\nPhan Thiet, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nGood food and good people\nMay 2023 • Couples\nI just came here for food at Waterfall.\nGreat welcomed by everyone at the lobby. Driven to the dining lounge by Ms. lovely and ardor Kim Anh.\n\nAbalone soup, mushroom au gratin, pan seared salmon and bacon wrapped scallops are fantastic. Thank you chefs for making great dishes. I recommened you should try these when come here for dinner\n\nBeautiful table set up by Ms Cang and she is great from the reservation stage. Mr. Tin is a well-trained waiter with nice photo taking skill under bad light condition of the restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2023",
